*> Edge cases of the 34-9 emitters (acceptance US15 34-9§7, §9, §13): an entity row that is no thrown type, a spawner without a stack or without room, a TNT whose item is unknown (content not open), a falling block whose state is the level's, unknown or has no item,
*> a minecart that carries no cube or whose item is unknown, the rotation about X of ENTITY-OPS-POINT, and the firework's shot-at-angle flag read from Set Entity Data (entry 10).
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-ENTITY-EDGES-9.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 COPY CLCONST.
 COPY CONTENT.
 COPY CLMODELS.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-ROW-AREA            PIC X(66).
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-TYPE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ID                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 7.
 01 WS-X                   FLOAT-LONG VALUE 10.5.
 01 WS-Y                   FLOAT-LONG VALUE 64.
 01 WS-Z                   FLOAT-LONG VALUE 10.5.
 01 WS-YAW                 FLOAT-SHORT.
 01 WS-PITCH               FLOAT-SHORT.
 01 WS-FIRST               BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-LAST                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-RANGE.
    05 WS-R                BINARY-LONG OCCURS 6 TIMES.
 01 WS-ROW                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-INDEX               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SER                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-INT                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FLOAT               FLOAT-SHORT.
 01 WS-EYE-TABLE.
    05 WS-EYE              FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 3 TIMES. 01 WS-OPS.
    05 WS-OP               FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 64 TIMES.
 01 WS-PT.
    05 WS-PV               FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 3 TIMES.
 01 WS-SC                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BID                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BIX                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BROW                PIC X(819).
 01 WS-BST                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FOUND               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LIM                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ONE                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-TEN                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 10.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "CL-INIT" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 0 TO PK-COUNT
     CALL "ENTITY-ATLAS-BUILD" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 256 TO PL-HEIGHT
     MOVE 0 TO SK-U
     MOVE 10 TO WS-EYE(1) WS-EYE(3)
     MOVE 64 TO WS-EYE(2)
     MOVE 1 TO CT-OPEN
     MOVE CT-TYPE-STANDARD TO CT-SET-TYPE
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE 1 TO WS-FIRST
     CALL "ENTITIES-CLEAR" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 0 TO EA-MT-COUNT
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY
     MOVE "pig" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-TYPE WS-ROW-AREA WS-STATUS
     MOVE 70 TO WS-ID
     MOVE 0 TO WS-YAW
     MOVE 0 TO WS-PITCH
     CALL "E9-SPAWN" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-TYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-PITCH
     MOVE 1 TO EN-STACK-COUNT(1)
     MOVE 4 TO EN-STACK-ITEM(1)
     CALL "ENTITY-THROWN-EMIT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-EYE-TABLE
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§7 an entity that is no thrown type draws nothing" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RL-GI-COUNT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "ENTITIES-CLEAR" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 0 TO EA-MT-COUNT
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY
     MOVE "ominous_item_spawner" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-TYPE WS-ROW-AREA WS-STATUS
     MOVE 71 TO WS-ID
     MOVE 0 TO WS-YAW
     MOVE 0 TO WS-PITCH
     CALL "E9-SPAWN" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-TYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-PITCH
     MOVE 0 TO EN-STACK-COUNT(1)
     CALL "ENTITY-SPAWNER-EMIT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-EYE-TABLE
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§9 a spawner without a stack draws nothing" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RL-GI-COUNT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 64 TO EN-STACK-COUNT(1)
     MOVE 4 TO EN-STACK-ITEM(1)
     COMPUTE WS-LIM = CL-MAX-GI-VERTICES - 5
     MOVE WS-LIM TO RL-GI-COUNT
     CALL "ENTITY-SPAWNER-EMIT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-EYE-TABLE
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§9 a spawner with less room than its copies adds nothing" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE WS-LIM TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RL-GI-COUNT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 0 TO RL-GI-COUNT
     CALL "ENTITIES-CLEAR" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 0 TO EA-MT-COUNT
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY
     MOVE "tnt" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-TYPE WS-ROW-AREA WS-STATUS
     MOVE 72 TO WS-ID
     MOVE 0 TO WS-YAW
     MOVE 0 TO WS-PITCH
     CALL "E9-SPAWN" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-TYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-PITCH
     MOVE 20 TO EN-VALUE(1)
     MOVE 0 TO CT-OPEN
     CALL "ENTITY-TNT-EMIT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-EYE-TABLE
     MOVE 1 TO CT-OPEN
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§13 a TNT whose item is unknown draws nothing" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RL-GI-COUNT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "ENTITIES-CLEAR" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 0 TO EA-MT-COUNT
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY
     MOVE "falling_block" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-TYPE WS-ROW-AREA WS-STATUS
     MOVE 73 TO WS-ID
     MOVE 0 TO WS-YAW
     MOVE 0 TO WS-PITCH
     CALL "E9-SPAWN" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-TYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-PITCH
     MOVE 0 TO EN-BSTATE(1)
     CALL "ENTITY-FALLING-EMIT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-EYE-TABLE
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§13 a falling block whose state the level holds is not drawn" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RL-GI-COUNT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 99999999 TO EN-BSTATE(1)
     CALL "ENTITY-FALLING-EMIT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-EYE-TABLE
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§13 a falling block of an unknown state draws nothing" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RL-GI-COUNT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 0 TO WS-FOUND
     PERFORM VARYING WS-SC FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-SC > 40000 OR WS-FOUND = 1
         CALL "CONTENT-BLOCK-OF-STATE" USING WS-SC WS-BID WS-BIX WS-BROW WS-BST
         MOVE WS-BROW TO CT-BLOCK-ROW
         IF CT-BR-KEY = "minecraft:water" OR "water"
             MOVE 1 TO WS-FOUND
             MOVE WS-SC TO EN-BSTATE(1)
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§13 the state of water was found" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-FOUND TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "ENTITY-FALLING-EMIT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-EYE-TABLE
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§13 a falling block with no item draws nothing" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RL-GI-COUNT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "ENTITIES-CLEAR" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 0 TO EA-MT-COUNT
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY
     MOVE "chest_minecart" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-TYPE WS-ROW-AREA WS-STATUS
     MOVE 74 TO WS-ID
     MOVE 0 TO WS-YAW
     MOVE 0 TO WS-PITCH
     CALL "E9-SPAWN" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-TYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-PITCH
     CALL "ENTITY-CART-EMIT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-EYE-TABLE
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§3 a chest minecart carries no cube" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RL-GI-COUNT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "ENTITIES-CLEAR" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 0 TO EA-MT-COUNT
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY
     MOVE "furnace_minecart" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-TYPE WS-ROW-AREA WS-STATUS
     MOVE 75 TO WS-ID
     MOVE 0 TO WS-YAW
     MOVE 0 TO WS-PITCH
     CALL "E9-SPAWN" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-TYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-PITCH
     MOVE 0 TO CT-OPEN
     CALL "ENTITY-CART-EMIT" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ROW WS-EYE-TABLE
     MOVE 1 TO CT-OPEN
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§3 a carried block whose item is unknown draws nothing" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RL-GI-COUNT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-OP(1)
     MOVE 5 TO WS-OP(2)
     MOVE 90 TO WS-OP(3)
     MOVE 0 TO WS-OP(4) WS-OP(5)
     MOVE 0 TO WS-PV(1) WS-PV(3)
     MOVE 1 TO WS-PV(2)
     CALL "ENTITY-OPS-POINT" USING WS-OPS WS-PT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§13 rotation about X of (0, 1, 0) by 90 degrees, component 1 (thousandths)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE FUNCTION INTEGER(WS-PV(1) * 1000 + 0.5) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§13 rotation about X of (0, 1, 0) by 90 degrees, component 2 (thousandths)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE FUNCTION INTEGER(WS-PV(2) * 1000 + 0.5) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§13 rotation about X of (0, 1, 0) by 90 degrees, component 3 (thousandths)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1000 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE FUNCTION INTEGER(WS-PV(3) * 1000 + 0.5) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "ENTITIES-CLEAR" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 0 TO EA-MT-COUNT
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY
     MOVE "firework_rocket" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-TYPE WS-ROW-AREA WS-STATUS
     MOVE 76 TO WS-ID
     MOVE 0 TO WS-YAW
     MOVE 0 TO WS-PITCH
     CALL "E9-SPAWN" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-TYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-PITCH
     CALL "E9-DATA-BOOL" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ID WS-TEN WS-ONE
     MOVE "acceptance US15 34-9§7 the shot-at-angle flag of Set Entity Data entry 10 is kept" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-X1(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     STOP RUN.
 END PROGRAM TEST-ENTITY-EDGES-9.
 COPY ENT9TEST.
 COPY CLTEST.
